{
  "_about": "A free trial link's claimers with what each spent (Growth > Free trial links / Profile promotion Details). OF's /subscriptions/subscribers?filter[trial_id] as the relay's link_metrics walks it. PII-free: synthetic ids, names, usernames, dates and amounts; only the shape is OF's.",
  "_source": "A user-supplied HAR of OF's own trial-link claimers list (2026-10-18): GET /api2/v2/subscriptions/subscribers?limit=10&offset=0|10&format=infinite&filter[trial_id]=<id>, {list, hasMore}. OF answered offset 0 with 9 fans and offset 10 with 10 different fans, hasMore true on both: a short page does not end the list, and the offset moves by the limit, not by the rows returned. Expired fans are listed too (subscribedOnExpiredNow). subscribedOnData.subscribeAt is ISO with +00:00; totalSumm = subscribesSumm + postsSumm + messagesSumm + streamsSumm + tipsSumm, in dollars. Rows trimmed to the fields read here.",
